00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,067
There is a puzzle.

2
00:00:01,067 --> 00:00:05,742
Drawn honestly, each secondary wavelet is a complete sphere.

3
00:00:05,742 --> 00:00:11,901
So there should also be a backward envelope, a wave travelling back towards the source.

4
00:00:11,901 --> 00:00:13,281
We never see one.

